  "body_html": "<p>Bring the excitement of the court into your bedroom with the personalized basketball sports comforter by Jeminise. Featuring a bold basketball design with custom name and number options, this lightweight bedding set is the perfect gift for basketball players, sports fans, and kids' rooms.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this sports bedding with your own name and player number for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling that prevents clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lightweight Warmth:</strong> Designed to provide comfortable, lightweight warmth suitable for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Craftsmanship:</strong> Features tight, smooth, and compact stitching along the edges with environmental protection dyeing techniques to prevent fading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on air dry without heat to regain fluffiness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
